{
  "info": {
    "name": "SEBA AI Studio — tRPC API",
    "_postman_id": "seba-ai-studio-trpc-v1",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the SEBA AI Studio tRPC API.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the `base_url` variable to your instance (default: `http://localhost:3000`)\n3. Run the **Login** request first to obtain a session cookie\n4. All subsequent protected requests will use the cookie automatically\n\n## Authentication\n\nThe API uses cookie-based sessions (`app_session_id`). After a successful login, Postman automatically stores the cookie and sends it with subsequent requests.\n\n## tRPC Wire Format\n\n- **Queries**: `GET /api/trpc/<router.procedure>?input={\"0\":{\"json\":{...}}}`\n- **Mutations**: `POST /api/trpc/<router.procedure>` with body `{\"0\":{\"json\":{...}}}`\n- **Batch format**: All requests use batch index `\"0\"` as the key\n- **Serialization**: Superjson (dates are serialized as ISO strings with metadata)\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n| Endpoint | Limit | Window |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| `aina.*` | 30 req | 60s |\n| `auth.*` | 20 req | 60s |\n| `mfa.*` | 10 req | 60s |\n| OAuth | 20 req | 60s |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication",
      "description": "Session management and login flows. Run Login first to authenticate.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Local Auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/localAuth.login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "localAuth.login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{\"email\":\"teacher@school.cat\",\"password\":\"your-password-here\"}}}"
            },
            "description": "Log in with email and password. On success, a session cookie (`app_session_id`) is set automatically. All subsequent requests will be authenticated.\n\n**Response:** `{ success: true, mustChangePassword: false, displayName: \"Teacher Name\" }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (auth.me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/auth.me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "auth.me"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the currently authenticated user object or `null` if not logged in. Use this to verify your session is active."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/auth.logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "auth.logout"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{}}}"
            },
            "description": "Clears the session cookie and logs out the current user."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Invite Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/localAuth.verifyInviteToken?input={\"0\":{\"json\":{\"token\":\"your-invite-token\"}}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "localAuth.verifyInviteToken"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "input", "value": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{\"token\":\"your-invite-token\"}}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verify a teacher invite token without consuming it. Returns `{ valid: true, email }` on success."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register (with Invite Token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/localAuth.register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "localAuth.register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{\"email\":\"newteacher@school.cat\",\"password\":\"SecurePass123!\",\"displayName\":\"Maria Garcia\",\"inviteToken\":\"your-invite-token\"}}}"
            },
            "description": "Register a new teacher account. Requires a valid invite token from a Director. Sets session cookie on success."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/localAuth.requestReset",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "localAuth.requestReset"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{\"email\":\"teacher@school.cat\",\"origin\":\"{{base_url}}\"}}}"
            },
            "description": "Request a password reset link. Always returns success to prevent user enumeration. Rate limited to 1 request per email per 5 minutes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/trpc/auth.changePassword",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trpc", "auth.changePassword"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"0\":{\"json\":{\"currentPassword\":\"old-password\",\"newPassword\":\"NewSecurePass456!\"}}}"
            },
            "description": "Change the current user's password. Requires the current password for verification. Protected procedure."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
